{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Radio Ghosts</i> is a narrative game about geometry tests, vampire baristas, and camping with your mom. It was created for and playable on the original Nintendo Game Boy, but through super-spooky frequencies is brought here to modern gaming machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you play as Liz, the main character, through the first few beats of the story. You're camping with your mom, but perhaps you'll meet some interesting denizens of the forest along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controls: arrow keys + Z key to interact. Xbox and PS4 / PS5 controllers are also supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-quality pixel graphics that only an original 160 x 144 resolution can provide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Genuine simulated four-way D-pad movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four shades of green</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Genuinely awesome original four-channel Game Boy soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the snark from a fifteen-year-old girl that you can handle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet interesting people and irritate them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Top-down super-fun non-Euclidean cartographic action</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Credits:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designer and developer: B.J. Best</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music: Joel Matthys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Graphics: 2bitcrook, Beachboogeyman, B.J. Best, Elvies, GibbonGL, Gumpy Function, Icko, MaterialFuture, Moshuo, PixelMech, The Pixel Nook, Reakain, Sondanielson, Timbo Johnson</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fonts: Codeman38, Joel J Games, Miffies, MxAshlynn, Santaigo Crespo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GB Studio and plugin: Chris Maltby, Pau Tomas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Windows wrapper: mooonbit, Timbo Johnson</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630750?t=1743706139","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630750/0b7c3d2fe8345057d577b284f81db8a31a07cc36/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743706139","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630750/a586c2079019ccdfb79102b54d7b86f12dda125e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743706139","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630750/a586c2079019ccdfb79102b54d7b86f12dda125e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743706139","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Radio Ghosts</i> is a narrative game about geometry tests, vampire baristas, and camping with your mom. It was created for and playable on the original Nintendo Game Boy, but through super-spooky frequencies is brought here to modern gaming machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you play as Liz, the main character, through the first few beats of the story. You're camping with your mom, but perhaps you'll meet some interesting denizens of the forest along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controls: arrow keys + Z key to interact. Xbox and PS4 / PS5 controllers are also supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-quality pixel graphics that only an original 160 x 144 resolution can provide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Genuine simulated four-way D-pad movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four shades of gree